+   * Compute intersection points $Q$ between edge $P_i P_j$ and edges of $R$ [S1, unofficial]. For edge $e_T$ (top), calculate $t = a^y_{ij} \cdot y_{\max} + b^y_{ij}$ and $Q = \mathcal{L}(P_i, P_j, t)$ [S1, unofficial].
